flowchart LR
  subgraph Sources
    DB[(Databases)]
    API[REST API]
    FILES[Files CSV/JSON/XML/Parquet/Avro]
    SFTP[SFTP]
    APP[App events]
  end
  DB --> BATCH[Batch/Incremental/CDC]
  API --> APII[API client]
  FILES --> FILE[File ingestion]
  SFTP --> FILE
  APP --> STREAM[Kinesis producer]
  BATCH & APII & FILE --> RAW[S3 Raw]
  RAW --> BRONZE[S3 Bronze] --> SILVER[S3 Silver] --> GOLD[S3 Gold]
  SILVER -. bad rows .-> QUAR[S3 Quarantine]
  GOLD --> ATHENA[Athena] & REDSHIFT[Redshift]
  STREAM --> KINESIS[Kinesis] --> FRAUD[Fraud detector] --> OS[OpenSearch]
  KINESIS --> FIREHOSE[Firehose] --> RAW
  ATHENA & REDSHIFT --> BI[BI / Dashboard]
